      "content": "i feel like i'm just constantly running but getting nowhere. everything is just... heavy. the debt, the job, the feeling that i've let everyone down because i can't keep up anymore. it's like i'm on this endless treadmill of misery and there's no off switch. i'm just so tired of trying to fix things that feel unfixable.",
